Native Americans once again looked to Sitting Bull for leadership as well as protection. His camp grew to more than ten thousand

28
00:03:44.447 --> 00:03:49.936
people, including about two thousand warriors. United under Sitting Bull, they moved from place to place&#8212;following the buffalo, searching for fresh grass for

29
