47
00:06:19.048 --> 00:06:26.967
for his people, but the U.S. government saw the dances as preparations for rebellion. On December 15, 1888, policemen who were Sioux

48
00:06:26.968 --> 00:06:35.254
but worked for the U.S. government were sent to arrest Sitting Bull. When his friends tried to intervene, shooting began. Sitting Bull was

